UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Apothecary Lydon sent you?  Ah, why didn\'t you say so!$B$BDespite his gloomy disposition, Apothecary Lydon is one of our most dedicated and skilled members.$B$BThe good chap sends Mudsnout Composite!  I know what our friend in Hillsbrad is up to now. And I like the way he thinks. The Dark Lady would be most impressed with the progress he is making toward the new plague.' WHERE `word_id` = 166225; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=513
