UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Bristlehorn is dead?!$B$BI should never have let him go there by himself.' WHERE `word_id` = 157380; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11687
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Bristlehorn should have returned by now.$B$BThe other reason why we came up here was to investigate that Scourge structure to the west, which fell from the sky. He\'s impetuous and has likely gotten himself into trouble.$B$B$N, go to that place and find him, please.' WHERE `word_id` = 157330; -- locales_quest - details : entry=11678
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Bristlepine can be dangerous, but most stay far away from wolvar. Wasps on other hand not fear the Frenzyheart... they even kill some of our hunters.$B$BI know Rakjak want wasp queen dead, but no wolvar want to go into her hive. You go kill wasp queen in Sapphire Hive to southeast and get stinger for Rakjak. Me bet Rakjak like that.' WHERE `word_id` = 160090; -- locales_quest - details : entry=12534
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brogg has completed the totem that will put the spirits of his friends to rest. When the dragonkin came, they killed all Stonemaul who did not flee. Brogg fled with Overlord Mok\'Morokk, hoping to lead a counterattack with other Stonemaul survivors.$B$BThe counterattack never came and the spirits of the Stonemaul dead still haunt Brogg and the others. Take this totem north to Stonemaul Ruins and use it near ogre skeletons to draw the spirit to you. Defeat the spirit to give it rest with its bones.' WHERE `word_id` = 153875; -- locales_quest - details : entry=11159
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brogg relishes the thought of taking his revenge on the black dragonkin of the marsh. $N, you have been very helpful in preparing for this moment. Will you help?$B$BTake Brogg\'s clan banner and travel east until you see a cave like a dragon\'s mouth. At the entrance to that cave, plant Stonemaul banner and issue Brogg\'s challenge to Onyxia.$B$BBrogg and the Stonemaul will have their lands back!' WHERE `word_id` = 153891; -- locales_quest - details : entry=11162
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brogg thanks you for your help, although he knows Overlord Mok\'Morokk never will. At least surviving Stonemaul can finally focus on problems with the living and leave dead where they belong. Only one thing remains for Brogg to do.' WHERE `word_id` = 153877; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11159
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brogg, at Mudsprocket, wants you to put 10 Stonemaul Spirits to rest.' WHERE `word_id` = 153876; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=11159
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brohann Caskbelly in Stormwind wants you to search for the Temple of Atal\'Hakkar.' WHERE `word_id` = 135646; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=1448
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Broken Wagon exploded' WHERE `word_id` = 172873; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=13944
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Broken? $B$BLet me have a look....' WHERE `word_id` = 157299; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11671
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brokentoe Defeated' WHERE `word_id` = 149111; -- locales_quest - EndText : entry=9962
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Bronwyn Stouthammer has asked you to collect 5 Draenethyst Mine Crystals and then return to her at Sylvanaar in the Blade\'s Edge Mountains.' WHERE `word_id` = 151293; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=10510
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Broodmother Slivina\'s likely to be a snarling ball of teeth, spikes, and talons. You\'ve gone and stolen her children away and no mother takes kindly to that.$B$B\'Tis true they hatched from eggs, but she loves the little beasts no less than your mother loves you.$B$BShe\'ll be desperate and fierce in equal measures, everything Hemet loves in a target. You and he, along with that mammoth, should be a match for her.$B$BShe\'s on her perch at the northern edge of the Savage Thicket and hungers for revenge.' WHERE `word_id` = 160450; -- locales_quest - details : entry=12614
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brother Anton still spreads the word of the Scarlet Crusade? Oh my....' WHERE `word_id` = 134536; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1052
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brother Keltan aboard Orgrim\'s Hammer wants you to rescue 10 Saronite Mine Slaves.' WHERE `word_id` = 163438; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=13302
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brother Silverhallow sent word that he wishes to speak with you. Next time you\'re in Orgrimmar, visit him in the Goblin Slums. It sounded like he had something important on his mind.' WHERE `word_id` = 187803; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28323
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brother,$B$BIf you are reading this letter, I am no more. How it got to you, I do not know, but thank and reward the ones responsible.$B$BAbout the stones: They exist and the Dark Irons have them in their possession. Their leader, Lathoric the Black, is using the power of the stones to enslave my excavation team. They were taken to the cauldron. Their minds are twisted, working night and day to complete something called Obsidion.$B$BHelp them, brother. It is the final wish of a dead man.$B$B-Dorius' WHERE `word_id` = 270840; -- locales_quest - details : entry=3368
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brothers of Earth and Fire, hear me! Sisters of the Water and Air, heed my call!$B$BAzeroth stands on the brink, its existence near an end! Lend me your power as in times past with my ancient ancestors. Allow me to channel your will through this child of Kezan.$B$BLet us put an end to those who would keep us from healing the world!' WHERE `word_id` = 173641; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14243
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brought Timeless Eye to Coldarra' WHERE `word_id` = 190119; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=29193
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Browman\'s Mill, to the north, is infested with undead. The Noxious Glade, even farther to the north, is even more heavily infested. Despite their proximity to our chapel, we have been unable to completely remove them.$B$BVigilance is key. Travel into the Noxious Vale and slay as many undead as you can find... and the cultists that roam among them.$B$BWhile there, make sure to avoid Garginox, the flesh giant that roams the vale. I suspect you are not strong enough to defeat him.' WHERE `word_id` = 184560; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27465
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Broyk wants you to find Stikwad at Thunder Peak.' WHERE `word_id` = 172673; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=13879
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brubaker is dead. It looks like the orcs are attempting to send a message with this grizzly display. Upon closer examination you notice something in Brubaker\'s pouch.' WHERE `word_id` = 181809; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26639
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brugar Stoneshear at the Westfall Brigade Encampment wants you to explore the North Building, the East Building, and the South Building of Thor Modan.' WHERE `word_id` = 158119; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=12003
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Bruno Flameretardant beaten down' WHERE `word_id` = 173236; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=14070
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Bruor Ironbane at Bouldercrag\'s Refuge wants you to kill 10 Nidavelir Stormforged. You may kill Stormforged Champions, Stormforged Magi, or Stormforged War Golems.' WHERE `word_id` = 162055; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=12978
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brutes and amateurs.$B$BIt doesn\'t matter how sharp or heavy your weapon is if all it\'s good for is hacking like an ogre. I could go on and on about finesse and speed and balance and control... but it\'s easier to one-up these fools.$B$BTell Deez we\'ve got one more order for him. I need a block of ice.' WHERE `word_id` = 188841; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28627
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Brutusk mounted' WHERE `word_id` = 172383; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=13628
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Buck Cantwell at the Nesingwary Base Camp wants you to identify 3 Shango Tracks from the Dreadsaber Tracks near Bittertide Lake.' WHERE `word_id` = 160174; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=12550
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Budd Nedreck in Hatchet Hills wants you to kill Hex Lord Malacrass in Zul\'Aman.' WHERE `word_id` = 153925; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=11171
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Budd Nedreck in Hatchet Hills wants you to retrieve his map from High Priest Nalorakk\'s terrace in Zul\'Aman.' WHERE `word_id` = 153759; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=11132
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Budd wants you to collect the Pewter Pounder from King Gurboggle at Gurboggle\'s Ledge.' WHERE `word_id` = 178534; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=25732
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Budd wants you to use the Booby-Trapped Bait at the Rusty Harpoon Gun in the Skeletal Reef.' WHERE `word_id` = 178195; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=25657
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Budding Artist Counseled' WHERE `word_id` = 186569; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText4 : entry=28002
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Bugs, bugs, bugs! The marsh is full of them and my companions here seem obsessed with them.$B$BWell, I\'ve had it with the bugs! Something far more intriguing has captured my interest. To the west, there is a village of Lost Ones who call themselves the Daggerfen.$B$BThe whole tribe consists of highly specialized assassins. I\'ve noticed them mixing and using a particularly potent kind of poison. I\'m dying to know more about the poison, but that\'s going to require a copy of the recipe and a sample vial.' WHERE `word_id` = 148651; -- locales_quest - details : entry=9848
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Build a murloc hovel at a site Groff marked with a flag on the nearby shore.' WHERE `word_id` = 172779; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=13910
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Build up a three-dwarf conga line' WHERE `word_id` = 186656; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=28034
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Bulwark Prisoners freed' WHERE `word_id` = 186987; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=28127
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Bumpy ride?' WHERE `word_id` = 174496; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14479
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Bunions, $G lad:lass;. Me bunions got bunions. How am I supposed to do any sort of killin\' with me feet in such disarray? That\'s why ye\'re gonna help.$B$BScrange and Burninate tasked me to kill these things so they can send some expeditionary teams down into the Slag Pit lava pools to do some explorin\'. Supposedly some incendosaurs or some such nonsense down there causin\' all kinds o\' problems. Now move along an\' don\'t come back \'til the incendosaur population be extinct.' WHERE `word_id` = 142397; -- locales_quest - details : entry=7727
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Burlguard sent you, did he?  Yes, I have spare weapons around here, but first I have a task for you...$B$BA while ago a Defias villain Dead-tooth Jack tricked me. It was dark and he was wearing a Stormwind tabard and I thought he was Marshal Dughan. He said he needed my old Stormwind Marshal\'s badge and I gave it to him... and then he laughed and ran off before I could catch him!$B$BGet back my badge!  Dead-tooth Jack probably has it stowed in his camp to the south.' WHERE `word_id` = 136076; -- locales_quest - details : entry=1667
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Burn 8 Grimtotem Weapon Racks.' WHERE `word_id` = 184052; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=27310
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Burn it down, $R. Burn it all down! They deserve nothing! Do you hear me! NOTHING! They must pay for what they have done. For what they continue to do.$B$BI would kill Vashj myself if I could break free of these damned bindings.$B$BOr maybe you seek to do the work of Neptulon? Her death serves both of us, soft-skin. Will you assist me in forming the sacred cudgel.' WHERE `word_id` = 152833; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10900
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Burn Stacks of Hay inside the Lost City of the Tol\'vir in Uldum.' WHERE `word_id` = 186244; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=27923
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Burn the Highvale Notes' WHERE `word_id` = 137691; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText2 : entry=2995
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Burn the Highvale Records' WHERE `word_id` = 137690; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=2995
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Burn the North Tent, East Tent, and the Northeast Tent at Direhorn Post, then return to Tabetha at her farm.' WHERE `word_id` = 153847; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=11150
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Burning Blade Slain' WHERE `word_id` = 189758; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=29090
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Burning Blade Warlocks Slain' WHERE `word_id` = 174221; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=14393
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Burning bodies?  No survivors?  I guessed correctly. All the better!  We\'re better off without the Scarlet taint upon Lordaeron. They epitomized all the worst things about humans.' WHERE `word_id` = 182819; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26930
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Burning Legion warp-gate sabotaged' WHERE `word_id` = 150557; -- locales_quest - EndText : entry=10310
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Bury the Light-Touched Blades in the bodies of 10 Slain Scourge Troopers.' WHERE `word_id` = 184571; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=27467
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Busted ball bearings! Look at this stuff - ugh, SMELL this stuff - my poor, poor dozer! $N, I consider myself a goop expert and this here goop ain\'t natural. It\'s supernatural. This is ghost goop. We\'re going to need more than a mechanic...' WHERE `word_id` = 173520; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14209
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Busy now. Go away. Wait, what? Hellscream sent you? What - uh - what can I do for you? Him? Us?' WHERE `word_id` = 180571; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26293
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='But none of that matters. What matters is that you\'ve seen your own Holy Light! You know where power truly comes from. You realize that having our own allies is much more... prudent. Special allies. Allies that, no matter the task, will obey till their last breath.$B$BAnd that\'s where I come in, $N. I can train you in the beginnings of those special powers. Seek me out often and I will do what I can to teach you more spells.' WHERE `word_id` = 137862; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=3115
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='But the thing I\'ve studied most is ooze. I know it sounds odd, but they\'re all over!$B$BI helped a lady in Menethil find her bag not too long ago--it was eaten by oozes. I\'ve seen members of the Royal Apothecary Society from Undercity collecting samples of the stuff. I want to know why! Where does it come from?$B$BI\'ve heard of more in Felwood. What I need are samples of the oozes there so I can further my research. I\'ll give you containers, you use them to collect a sample from the deceased creatures.' WHERE `word_id` = 139227; -- locales_quest - details : entry=4512
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='But wait, what\'s this? Shreev left the safety on. That will limit the amount of power I can draw from the booster at any time. I told him I wanted it off! This is no good.$B$BYou have to take this to the Gadgetzan Gizmorium in the Tanaris Desert and have Shreev remove this.' WHERE `word_id` = 135087; -- locales_quest - details : entry=1188
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='But you did not come here for a history lesson, did you? You came for the Eternal Flame and fire totem.$B$BThe first step is to create a sapta and bind you to the flame.$B$BI can create the fire sapta for you if you bring me two items. The first is fire tar, a simple item usually carried by Razormane spellcasters in eastern Barrens.$B$BThe second item will be more dangerous: a reagent pouch from one of the cultists of the Burning Blade. You can find them in a cave above the ravines northeast of Razor Hill.' WHERE `word_id` = 135906; -- locales_quest - details : entry=1525
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='But, as much as it pains me, there is one thing that must be done first: I have to find Trey\'s sword Lightforge and escape Shadow Hold to tell my superiors what\'s happening here. Can you help me, $N?$B$BOur equipment isn\'t far from here, and you\'ve already proven you can survive the path to the top.$B$BAfter we escape, I\'ll head to Darnassus if you can find my friend Jessir near the Ashenvale border. She was to meet us at the Emerald Circle\'s camp near there.$B$BWhat do you say, $N? Can you help me again?' WHERE `word_id` = 140034; -- locales_quest - details : entry=5203
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='But, there may be more centaur than I thought, I ask you, $N, to fight with me against these vile assassins.' WHERE `word_id` = 139596; -- locales_quest - details : entry=4966
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Buy a bat ride to Brill from the bat master Michael Garrett, then bring Gordon\'s Crate to Deathguard Morris in Brill.' WHERE `word_id` = 168002; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=6324
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Buy a bat ride to the Undercity from the bat master Karos Razok, then take Podrig\'s Order to Gordon Wendham in the Undercity.' WHERE `word_id` = 141198; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=6323
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Buy a gryphon ride from the gryphon master Bartlett the Brave, then bring Argus Note to Osric Strang, in the shop Limited Immunity, in the Old Town of Stormwind.' WHERE `word_id` = 337558; -- locales_quest - CompletedText : entry=26394
