UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Definitely... I can see exactly what the core must look like. If any of the frostborn have seen it, they\'ll be sure to recognize the description.$B$BThere\'s no time to waste, let\'s get straight to business. Go talk to King Stormheart and request his aid... he\'s sure to know someone who can help us find the core. And be nice about it will you - he\'s very respected around here.' WHERE `word_id` = 161608; -- locales_quest - details : entry=12873
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Deirom\'s cargo doesn\'t seem to have been harmed or even opened. The cargo clearly seemed of interest to them, but it seems their prisoner was more important. What the arakkoa hoped to gain from attacking and kidnapping Deirom remains unclear, but the merchant is certainly not being held here. $B$BWithout any further clues as to how to continue your search, you decide it might be a good time to report your findings to Thander.' WHERE `word_id` = 149038; -- locales_quest - details : entry=9943
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Delays, delays, delays! I\'m at wit\'s end!$B$BI was told that this goblin was brilliant - that he\'d come up with gadgets sure to shock the enemy into submission. So far he\'s produced nothing but empty promises. If he comes up empty-handed again, I\'m going to toss him off the cliff!$B$BYou go and speak to him, $C. Let him know that my fuse is running short!' WHERE `word_id` = 172845; -- locales_quest - details : entry=13936
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Delays, delays... the one thing we cannot afford right now!$B$BAs much as I hate to disturb Lord Surristrasz, he\'s our only hope of saving our beloved Evanor.$B$BBring him the key fragments and hope that his mood is favorable.$B$BHurry, $C, our assault team is waiting.' WHERE `word_id` = 157334; -- locales_quest - details : entry=11679
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Delber\'s technicians have been up day and night helping us prepare for this strike. Aside from building and tuning the personnel launcher, his men have prepared the covert operations air wing for a strike on Frostmane Retreat. They\'ll be waiting for a signal to begin their strikes.$B$BTake this flare with you, and set it off near the cluster of buildings at the northern end of the village, and the buildings at the southern end of the village. The flying machines will make a quick strike at each site.' WHERE `word_id` = 178912; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25841
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Delgren has asked me to deliver messages and supplies to Sentinel Starbreeze in Auberdine, but I am loathe to leave on my own. Dangerous foes operate in the forest, and I do not wish to risk letting these supplies and information fall into the wrong hands.$B$BIf you and others could act as my guards, I could leave now. With your protection, I have no doubt that we can see these goods safely to Auberdine.' WHERE `word_id` = 134253; -- locales_quest - details : entry=976
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Deliah had a husband, Raleigh, who now dwells in the Undercity. If the Deliah who lived in Brill is the one who owned this ring, then Raleigh will know.$B$BRaleigh is in the Trade Quarter of the Undercity.' WHERE `word_id` = 132020; -- locales_quest - details : entry=441
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Deliana had you contact me? I\'ll do my best to help you, but first I must ask a great favor of you.' WHERE `word_id` = 144593; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8929
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Delicious!$B$BAzy always trying to get his hands on magic artifacts. Said he was trying to make friends with that archmage person. Xylem!$B$BXylem has LOTS of apprentices. Takes in all kinds, burns\'m out, leaves them wandering all over. High turnover.$B$BLast one was last night. Headed over towards that big goblin tower construction thing, way west. Maybe he\'ll help you meet Xylem? Maybe Xylem knows where Azy is?$B$BPlay nice!' WHERE `word_id` = 174055; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14345
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Delightful! This will do splendidly...$B$BHere, good $N, take this as payment for your honorable deed.' WHERE `word_id` = 130799; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=157
