UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='High Shaman Rakjak always tell stories of mighty warriors, even ones far away. Sometimes he tell stories about giant bear-men fighting great battle for tree-city.$B$BMaybe you take Kekek there, see tree, see battle! High Shaman Rakjak tell Kekek that giant tree-city Grizzlemaw stand in the middle of Grizzly Hills.$B$BKekek never see a city before meeting orphan lady, but this city have no warriors, only men in purple dresses. Kekek want to see real warriors fight for real city.' WHERE `word_id` = 164499; -- locales_quest - details : entry=13930
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='High Sorcerer Andromath wishes to speak with you, $N. He is at the top of the wizard\'s sanctum, in the mage\'s district of Stormwind.$B$BIt would be wise to speak with him, for Andromath is one of the most powerful mages not locked away in Dalaran. Council with him is high council indeed.' WHERE `word_id` = 136469; -- locales_quest - details : entry=1939
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='High Tinker Mekkatorque asked me to write a speech that he could give before the battle starts, but I can\'t tell which draft is good and which ones just stink.$B$BCould you try some of them out on some of the local gnome residents?  This device creates an image of Mekkatorque saying a few lines from each of my speech drafts.$B$BLet me know which one works, okay?' WHERE `word_id` = 165439; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25283
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='High up in the cliffs above me there is a large crystal pylon. Who placed it there, I cannot say, nor can I determine any reason that it would be built in such a strange place.$B$BMaybe you can make more of it than I can. I personally don\'t care what it does, so you needn\'t report back to me, but perhaps one of the scholars in Marshal\'s Stand might be interested in what you discover.' WHERE `word_id` = 175372; -- locales_quest - details : entry=24721
