UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Ricket at K3 would like you to locate the Transporter Power Cell and use it to activate the Transportation Pad at Garm\'s Rise.' WHERE `word_id` = 161358; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=12821
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Ricket should be at Malfurion\'s Breach with Damek, as you requested. I\'m not sure you fully know what you\'re getting into with those two though.$B$BSpeaking of which, you should probably go check on them... make sure they haven\'t managed to blow up the Sentinel Tree itself. As long as you keep them busy with the elementals, the chances of "accidents" at the breach should lessen dramatically.' WHERE `word_id` = 190618; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29282
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Ridding Felwood of Xavathras is only the first step in a long process. It will take much work to repair the damage that has been done here.$B$BI sense that there is something much larger than just the satyrs at work here, but we will only know the truth with time...' WHERE `word_id` = 139103; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=4421
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Ridding Sunfury Hold of its garrison is not sufficient to keep the blood elves from reoccupying it. Kael\'thas\'s followers are zealous and tenacious. Leaving them anything to use at Sunfury is effectively an invitation to return.$B$BNo, it must all be destroyed. See to it that their tents and artillery burn to ashes!$B$B<The ghost\'s fists clench.>$B$BSteal torches from the Sunfury flamekeepers to accomplish your task, $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 150193; -- locales_quest - details : entry=10233
