UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc10`='Screed likes to say his flying is as "smooth as butter." I think "butterfingered" is more like it!$B$BTake a look at the wreckage over there. He calls it a "rough" landing.$B$BSure, we got shot at, but I\'d be willing to cut him a little more slack if he didn\'t brag about his piloting skills so often!$B$BI think I\'m going to make him a batch of wings to drive the point home. To the east, in the Valley of Bones, you\'ll find bonestripper buzzards. Their wings are plump, juicy, and perfect for my needs.' WHERE `word_id` = 146719; -- locales_quest - details : entry=9356
